---
layout: layouts/base.njk
htmlLang: en
ogLocale: en_US
title: Costumes — Luxury Cover Band
description: "Stage looks by Luxury Cover Band: red, black glitter, gold, white and themed stage costumes for weddings, corporate events and TV shoots."
keywords: "stage costumes cover band, Luxury Cover Band looks, red stage costumes, white stage costumes"
permalink: /en/costumes/
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--list">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<p class="page-hero__breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">{{ site.shortName }}</a> <span>·</span><span>Costumes</span></p>
		<p class="page-hero__eyebrow">Stage looks</p>
		<h1 class="page-hero__title">Stage costumes.</h1>
		<p class="page-hero__lead">Red, black glitter, gold, white and themed stage costumes for weddings, corporate events, private parties and TV shoots.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--flush">
	<ul class="ig-grid">
		{% for c in promoGallery.costumes %}
		<li class="ig-tile">
			<a class="ig-tile__link" href="{{ ('/assets/costumes/' + c.slug + '.jpg') | url }}" data-lightbox>
				<img data-photo-layout="costume" src="{{ ('/assets/costumes/' + c.slug + '.jpg') | url }}" alt="{{ c.titleEn }} — Luxury Cover Band stage look" title="{{ c.titleEn }} — Luxury Cover Band stage look" loading="{{ 'eager' if c.priority else 'lazy' }}"{% if c.priority %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>
				<span class="ig-tile__caption">{{ c.titleEn }}</span>
			</a>
		</li>
		{% endfor %}
	</ul>
</section>

<section class="section section--book" id="booking">
	<div class="container container--narrow reveal">
		<h2 class="section__title">Choose a stage look.</h2>
		<p class="section__lead">Send the date, preferred lineup and the name or photo of a look you like. We will confirm costume availability for those musicians and agree the look with your programme and venue.</p>
		<div class="book__cta"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">Discuss the look on WhatsApp</a></div>
	</div>
</section>
